gh the Events Desk, including Riverside Hall, Baner Tech Hub and Hinjewadi Convention Suites [Doc_11 §0]. Cancellations made 15 or more calendar days before the event receive a full refund of the room charge, cancellations made between 7 and 14 calendar days before the event receive a 50 percent refund of the room charge, and cancellations made fewer than 7 calendar days before the event are not refunded and the full room charge is billed to the requesting cost centre [Doc_11 §1]. Cancellations caused by government orders, severe weather warnings or venue closures are fully refunded regardless of timing [Doc_11 §4]. Cancellations must be submitted through the Events Desk portal using the booking confirmation number, and email cancellations are not accepted [Doc_11 §5]. An event may be rescheduled once without penalty if the new date is within 60 days of the original date and the request is made at least 7 calendar days before the original date [Doc_11 §2]. Catering orders follow the caterer's own terms, and in-house catering at Riverside Hall must be cancelled at least 72 hours before the event or 100 percent of the catering order is charged [Doc_11 §3].\n\n\nRiverside Hall operates an in-house kitchen and does not allow outside caterers [Doc_1 §1]. Baner Tech Hub has no in-house kitchen, and food must be arranged through an approved external caterer from the vendor directory [Doc_1 §2]. Riverside Hall's in-house menu has Jain options [Doc_7 §@00:04-01:33]. Hinjewadi Convention Suites includes a working lunch and two tea breaks in the standard rate [Doc_1 §3].","claims":[{"id":"t1_v1_c1","text":"The cancellation policy applies to every venue booked through the Events Desk, including Riverside Hall, Baner Tech Hub and Hinjewadi Convention Suites [Doc_11 §0].","chunkIds":["c8ba5e906dda6e84_0"],"subQueryId":"t1_sq1","support":1.0},{"id":"t1_v1_c2","text":"Cancellations made 15 or more calendar days before the event receive a full refund of the room charge, cancellation